      "status": "ok",
      "output": {
        "decision": "answer",
        "reason": "The evidence directly addresses both observed seq2seq shortcomings and proposed solutions. The Abstract identifies overconfidence and incomplete transcriptions with language models. The 'Solutions to Partial Transcripts Problem' section details three strategies for incomplete transcripts: forbidding EOS unless near the most probable token, extending the beam criterion with a length term, and a coverage-penalty term at decode time. Related Work discusses label smoothing and coverage penalty at decode time as remedies for overconfidence/implicit context. Together these support the answer."
      },
      "elapsed_ms": 3825.942299910821
    },
    {
      "stage": "Generate",
      "attempt": 1,
      "input": {
        "decision": "answer"
      },
      "status": "ok",
      "citation_validation": {
        "id_valid": true,
        "source_consistent": true,
        "semantic_support": "not_evaluated"
      },
      "output": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "two_shortcomings",
            "text": "论文指出基于注意力的seq2seq语音识别系统存在两个缺陷：预测过度自信，以及在使用语言模型时倾向于生成不完整的转写。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-c1a01afddd733ef65ed6d199"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "practical_solutions",
            "text": "作者称针对这两个问题提出了实用解决方案，并在Wall Street Journal数据集上取得有竞争力的说话人无关词错误率：不单独使用语言模型时为10.6% WER，结合三元语言模型时为6.7% WER。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-c1a01afddd733ef65ed6d199"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "eos_forbidden_strategy",
            "text": "三种防止不完整转写的策略之一是：不改变束搜索准则，但除非EOS token的概率处于最可能token概率的某一设定范围内，否则禁止输出EOS；该策略可防止截断，但对转写中部的遗漏无效。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "length_term_and_looping",
            "text": "另一种做法是在束搜索准则中加入促进长转写的项，但基于转写长度的项在CTC和seq2seq网络中被报告使用困难，因为束搜索会在录音的某些部分上循环，需要额外约束。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "coverage_term",
            "text": "为防止循环，作者提出使用覆盖项，统计累计注意力超过给定阈值的帧数；一旦某帧被计为已选中，后续再次选中该帧不会降低解码代价。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "coverage_recomputed",
            "text": "在其实现中，覆盖度在每个束搜索迭代中利用截至该步产生的所有注意力权重重新计算。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "coverage_penalty_decode_only",
            "text": "作者采用仅在解码时施加覆盖惩罚的方案，这与Google翻译系统所用的方案最为相似；相关工作还提到覆盖向量在神经机器翻译中已被研究。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-7549a11343a20fbc64d6dc01"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "label_smoothing_related",
            "text": "相关工作指出label smoothing能防止SoftMax饱和并改善向低层的梯度流，并讨论全局归一化模型能否由配合label smoothing等正则化的局部归一化模型近似尚待确定。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-7549a11343a20fbc64d6dc01"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "overconfidence_observation",
            "text": "作者观察到seq2seq模型常给出非常尖锐的预测，只需考虑少数假设即可找到最可能的转写，但高置信度会降低束搜索所得转写的多样性。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-0b5bc372895d6d0706b56a8e"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "wide_beam_incomplete",
            "text": "论文指出使用语言模型时，宽束搜索常产生不完整转写；窄束时由于隐式假设剪枝，该问题不太明显。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1612.02695",
                "chunk_id": "c-753acdce1e13381d0f0064dc"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "decision": "answer"
      },
